                                        "sense_id": "a3a408f7-6843-39af-a121-48f40969f92c",
                                        "entry_id": "6e5fbb2c-3bd4-3eba-89e8-9ee573f71c90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clear colourless organic acid, CH₃COOH, formed by the bacterial oxidation of ethanol through acetic fermentation; it is used as a solvent and has very many industrial applications; it is the major acidic component of vinegar."
                                        ],
